  "editorial_note": {
    "ja": "再構成・直交性・後退誤差が小さくても、悪条件問題の前進誤差は大きくなり得ます。入力した浮動小数点行列と理想的に指定した特異値を区別し、数値階数の閾値も明記します。",
    "en": "Small reconstruction, orthogonality and backward errors do not ensure small forward error for an ill-conditioned problem. Distinguish the actual floating-point matrix from its intended singular values and state the numerical-rank threshold."
  },
